      "review_summary": "Adds an optional sandbox `skipSkillsSync` flag that skips copying skills into sandbox workspaces, propagates it through sandbox context and prompt paths, and adds focused unit tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +60, Tests +45. Total +105 across 9 files.\n\nReproducibility: not applicable. as a feature PR. Source inspection shows current main and v2026.6.11 still always call sandbox skill sync, so the performance premise is plausible but not a broken existing behavior repro.",
